TI  - Effects of Low Oxygen Dosages on an Anaerobic Membrane Bioreactor, Simulating the Oxygen Load in an Anaerobic Digester-Dissolved Air Flotation (AD-DAF) System
AU  - Piaggio, Antonella L.
AU  - Sasidhar, K.B.
